{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039700/extras/f018d0f1c1c398efcb368931c876af1f.poster.avif?t=1759140075\" width=700 height=104 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039700/extras/f018d0f1c1c398efcb368931c876af1f.webm?t=1759140075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039700/extras/f018d0f1c1c398efcb368931c876af1f.mp4?t=1759140075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc8e <strong>MEET COLOMBINA!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In celebration of the Harvest Festival, the famed mistress of the Undead Circus has abandoned her gloomy domain and reinvented herself... as a purveyor of irresistible, juicy apples! Dare to taste one? Don't worry, it's not poisoned... although with Colombina, anything's possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She draws attention to her bountiful harvest with breathtaking acrobatic performances. Her flexibility knows no bounds! And when she dances without a stitch of underwear... well, the spectacle is unforgettable! After the show, she loves to hide in the haylofts and startle unsuspecting farmers. And if you catch her eye, she might just whisk you away... for a little midnight mischief!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039700/extras/13ff10285fa6df2ed932c3be3397e596.webp?t=1759140075\" width=633 height=43 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcdc <strong>WHAT ELSE DO YOU GET?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By purchasing this DLC, you'll unlock Colombina as your mascot! You can switch mascots anytime by opening the &quot;Mascot&quot; tab on the home screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll also receive 10,000 Gold, 100 Rubies and 10 Common Mystic Tomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But most importantly\u2014you'll have our heartfelt thanks. Thank you for choosing to support this DLC!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039700/extras/13ff10285fa6df2ed932c3be3397e596.webp?t=1759140075\" width=633 height=43 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4039700?t=1759140075","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4039700?t=1759140075","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039700/da684c39c642cdf9d4827de4c6c57ce128b7b2ce/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759140075","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039700/da684c39c642cdf9d4827de4c6c57ce128b7b2ce/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759140075","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"All characters in the game are over 20 years old. This DLC contains explicit adult themes, including nudity and sexual acts. Please be aware and ensure that you are in an appropriate location before playing to avoid causing distress to others."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039700/extras/f018d0f1c1c398efcb368931c876af1f.poster.avif?t=1759140075\" width=700 height=104